WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.273
"Emmy," called Dad.

2
00:00:09.274 --> 00:00:12.271
"Rover needs a walk."

3
00:00:12.272 --> 00:00:16.061
"I want to play soccer," said Emmy.

4
00:00:16.062 --> 00:00:27.121
"You can play later," said Dad.

5
00:00:27.122 --> 00:00:32.433
Emmy got Rover's leash.

6
00:00:32.434 --> 00:00:39.641
She took Rover outside.

7
00:00:39.642 --> 00:00:43.309
Rover saw a cat.

8
00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:47.444
He wanted to chase it.

9
00:00:47.445 --> 00:00:51.208
"No, Rover!" Emmy said.

10
00:00:51.209 --> 00:00:55.197
She pulled Rover away.

11
00:00:55.198 --> 00:01:00.143
Rover saw a garden.

12
00:01:00.144 --> 00:01:06.610
He wanted to dig in it.

13
00:01:06.611 --> 00:01:10.921
"No, Rover!" Emmy said.

14
00:01:10.922 --> 00:01:15.950
She pulled Rover away.

15
00:01:15.951 --> 00:01:23.112
Rover saw some trash.

16
00:01:23.113 --> 00:01:26.074
He wanted to eat it.

17
00:01:26.075 --> 00:01:29.662
"No, Rover!" Emmy said.

18
00:01:29.663 --> 00:01:38.120
She pulled Rover away.

19
00:01:38.121 --> 00:01:41.036
Then Rover heard something.

20
00:01:41.037 --> 00:01:44.766
He wagged his tail.

21
00:01:44.767 --> 00:01:49.965
He started to run.

22
00:01:49.966 --> 00:01:53.818
Rover pulled the leash out of Emmy's hands.

23
00:01:53.819 --> 00:02:00.101
"Come back, Rover!" Emmy cried.

24
00:02:00.102 --> 00:02:02.970
Rover did not come back.

25
00:02:02.971 --> 00:02:05.945
He ran down the sidewalk.

26
00:02:05.946 --> 00:02:09.118
Emmy ran after him.

27
00:02:09.119 --> 00:02:12.891
Rover ran into the park.

28
00:02:12.892 --> 00:02:17.206
There were lots of kids there.

29
00:02:17.207 --> 00:02:20.864
They were playing soccer.

30
00:02:20.865 --> 00:02:25.780
Rover wanted to play too.

31
00:02:25.781 --> 00:02:29.110
"No, Rover!" Emmy said.

32
00:02:29.111 --> 00:02:32.585
It was too late.

33
00:02:32.586 --> 00:02:35.814
Rover chased the ball.

34
00:02:35.815 --> 00:02:41.237
He chased it right into a goal!

35
00:02:41.238 --> 00:02:48.812
The kids all laughed.

36
00:02:48.813 --> 00:02:55.306
"Your dog is a good soccer player," one kid said.

37
00:02:55.307 --> 00:02:58.462
Emmy looked at Rover.

38
00:02:58.463 --> 00:03:01.839
He wagged his tail.

39
00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:06.403
"You did not want a walk, Rover," said Emmy.

40
00:03:06.404 --> 00:03:14.884
"You wanted to play soccer too!"

